## Proposed Changes

### Komponen 1: WebSocket Event Mismatch Fix (Catatan 7 — P0 Critical)

#### [MODIFY] [useHardwareRequestRealtime.ts](file:///d:/iDesk-main/apps/frontend/src/features/hardware-request/hooks/useHardwareRequestRealtime.ts)

**Masalah:** Event name mismatch antara frontend listener dan backend emitter.

| Frontend Listen | Backend Emit | Status |
|---|---|---|
| `comment-added` | `new_comment` | ❌ MISMATCH |
| `status-changed` | `status_changed` | ❌ MISMATCH (dash vs underscore) |
| `schedule-updated` | `schedule_proposed` / `schedule_confirmed` / `schedule_rescheduled` | ❌ MISMATCH |
| `install-progress` | (tidak ada) | ❌ DEAD LISTENER |
| `join-request` | `subscribe_request` | ❌ MISMATCH |
| `leave-request` | `unsubscribe_request` | ❌ MISMATCH |

**Fix:**
```typescript
// Sync semua event name ke backend (underscore convention)
s.emit('subscribe_request', { requestId });
s.on('status_changed', onStatusChanged);
s.on('new_comment', onComment);
s.on('schedule_proposed', onSchedule);
s.on('schedule_confirmed', onSchedule);
s.on('schedule_rescheduled', onSchedule);
// cleanup juga sync
s.emit('unsubscribe_request', { requestId });
```

